  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Frenetic Fanfare, ability or class feature that requires a Perform skill.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> When you apply the Frenetic Fanfare flair, you may instead choose to activate a perform ability you have from another source. If you do so the action required to start the Performance decreases by one step, standard to move, move to swift, swift to free, and so on.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/braggart#toc43\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
